<title>USA: Lincoln to acquire Voyageur Fund Managers.</title>
<headline>Lincoln to acquire Voyageur Fund Managers.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lincoln National Corp said it entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Voyageur Fund Managers, primarily a tax-free bonds fund firm, for about $69 million in Lincoln stock.</p>
<p>Voyageur manages 23 open-end single-state municipal bond funds and other open-end funds with combined assets under management of $2.2 billion, Lincoln said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
